            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SteadyMelt2455"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have always thought the John Collins was much less popular than it deserved to be, and this recipe gets the proportions just right. Recently, I tried substituting Meadowland High Desert simple syrup for my homemade syrup, and that took this highball to a whole other level. The Meadowland syrups are a bit pricey, but upgrading the syrup in this drink is a lot more cost-effective than splurging on top-shelf bourbon.",
            "datePublished": "2022-05-28T18:22:58.408Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I gave this a try when I saw LTH's photo! I had to make some changes according to what I had on hand! I subbed pink champagne for the club soda and a raspberry for the cherry. I also doubled the simple syrup because unlike LTH, I like sweet drinks! This was VERY good! John Collins can come to my party anytime! =D",
            "datePublished": "2013-02-07T16:51:39.950Z"
          }
